Minimal cosmic composition of a single large soft orb of electric blue #4F83FF light glowing from the right edge of a near-black #0A0A0C sky. Concentric faint halos ripple outward into midnight navy #1A2340, with tiny cool-white stars scattered sparsely, gentle volumetric haze and fine grain, and a calm, deep, dark top area. 8K quality, ultra smooth gradients, premium feel, no text, no letters, no UI elements, no device mockups